<section class="faq">
  <div class="faq-grid">
    <h2 class="h2">FAQs</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Why mullein for lung support?</summary>
        <p>People have used mullein for lung support since the 1500s. It thins mucus so your airways can move air more easily. We pair it with chlorophyll because the two work well together on cellular oxygen support. Each dropper delivers the equivalent of 2,800mg of raw mullein.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How long until I feel results?</summary>
        <p>Most people notice clearer airways and less coughing in 2 to 4 weeks. Some feel it within the first dose, especially if they're dealing with heavy congestion. If you're an ex-smoker or recovering from a respiratory illness, give it 60 to 90 days. That's why the guarantee runs that long.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Is this safe for ex-smokers and ex-vapers?</summary>
        <p>Yes. It's our most common customer. Mullein has a long history of helping lungs recover from smoke. Most of our reviews are from people years off cigarettes or vapes who say this was the first thing that actually helped them clear residue and breathe deeper.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What's in it?</summary>
        <p>Two active ingredients per serving: 280mg of mullein leaf 10:1 extract and 100mg of chlorophyll. Glycerin base. No alcohol. Vegan, non-GMO, gluten-free. Every batch is tested by an outside lab for potency, heavy metals, and microbials. We'll send the COA if you ask.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Can I take this with my medications?</summary>
        <p>Mullein and chlorophyll are well-tolerated for most people. But if you're on prescriptions, especially inhalers, blood thinners, or diabetes meds, check with your doctor before adding any supplement. Dr. Chris (our pharmacist) formulated this, but he still wants you to loop in your own doctor.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What does the Air Quality Report include?</summary>
        <p>A free PDF report for your zip code. Current particulate matter levels, allergen forecast, top local pollutants, wildfire history, and a doctor-written action plan. Lands in your inbox right after you sign up.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How does the 90-day money-back guarantee work?</summary>
        <p>Try it for 90 days. If it isn't doing anything for you, email support@trybetterbrand.com and we'll refund every penny. Bottle empty or full, no questions. Most people never use it.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How does subscription work?</summary>
        <p>$27.95 a bottle, shipped every 30 days. Free shipping. Pause, skip, change frequency, or cancel anytime from your account. No phone calls.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
